cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: moljax
abstract: >-
  An open-source JAX library for GPU-accelerated method-of-lines
  simulation of stiff reaction-diffusion PDEs on structured grids,
  combining JIT-compiled adaptive time stepping, matrix-free
  Newton-Krylov solvers with automatic differentiation, and FFT/DST/DCT
  spectral operators with physics-aware preconditioning.
type: software
